  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Salem, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nMission Statement \nThe mission of the Town Clerk Department is to provide the residents and businesses of Salem efficient, friendly, accurate and timely service and information regarding the many services that we provide. \nFunctions \nThe Town Clerk's office functions include: \nMarriage Licenses (Appointment Required) \nApplicants for a marriage license  must  make an appointment with the Town Clerk or Deputy Town Clerk and both parties must be present with all required documentation at time of application. \nVital Statistics & Records \nElections \nVoter Registration / Party Change / Absentee Ballot Request \nDog Licenses \nMaintaining Town Records \nVoter Registration Applications and Information \nState and Federal Tax Liens and Attachments \nSheriff's Writs \nArticles of Agreement (Non-Profit Filings) \nPole Permits \nOaths of Office \nFiling of NHDES Dredge and Fill Applications \r\nContact Us \nContact the Town Clerk Office! \nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n\t\t\t\t\t 33 Geremonty Drive \n\t\t\t\t\t Salem ,  NH   03079 \r\nPhone:  603-890-2110 \r\nFax: 603-685-6402 \r\nHours \nMonday through Friday \n8:30 am to 5 pm \nAll Motor Vehicle Transactions  stop  at 4:30 pm \r\n\t\t\t\t\tNicole Morse\r\nTown Clerk \r\nPhone:  603-890-2116 \r\n\t\t\t\t\tDeborah Sweeney\r\nDeputy Town Clerk \r\nPhone:  603-685-6407 \r\n\t\t\t Frequently Asked Questions \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Certified Vital Records \r\n\t\t\t Marriage Licenses \r\n\t\t\t Local & State Elections \r\n\t\t\t\t Historical Election Data: Overview \r\n\t\t\t\t Primary Turnout Party Breakdown \r\n\t\t\t\t Historical Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Election Workers Employment Application \r\n\t\t\t\t Redistricting \r\n\t\t\t\t Absentee Ballot Application \r\n\t\t\t\t Election Results \r\n\t\t\t Online Services \r\n\t\t\t Supervisors of the Checklist Meeting Notices \r\n\t\t\t Election Workers Employment Application \r\n\t\t\t Useful Links \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Online Services \r\n\t\t\t Maps & Property Info \r\n\t\t\t Public Records \r\n\t\t\t Stay Connected \r\n\t\t\t Employment \r\nContact Us \r\nSalem Town Hall \n33 Geremonty Drive \nSalem, NH 03079 \nPhone:  603-890-2000 \r\nHelpful Links \r\n         Utilities \n         Town Reports \n         Community Events \n         Community News \n         Report a Concern \n         Site Login \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
